[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: L2 — Provisioning
UID: QMGMT-L2P
VERSION: 0.1
OPTIONS:
  MARKUP: RST
  AUTO_LEVELS: On

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: requirements.sgra

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Qube lifecycle

[PRODUCT_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L2P-LIFECYCLE-010
TITLE: Qube creation
STATEMENT: >>>
The management tool shall create a qube of a caller-specified class from a
caller-specified template.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Ansible, Salt, QubesTools, Terraform
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L1-STATE
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_create

[PRODUCT_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L2P-LIFECYCLE-020
TITLE: Qube cloning
STATEMENT: >>>
The management tool shall create a new qube as a copy of an existing qube,
including that qube's configuration.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Ansible, Salt, QubesTools, Terraform
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L1-STATE
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_create
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_volume_clone_to

[PRODUCT_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L2P-LIFECYCLE-021
TITLE: Qube renaming
STATEMENT: >>>
The management tool shall rename an existing qube, preserving its storage and the
settings of qubes that refer to it.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Ansible, Salt, QubesTools, Terraform
RATIONALE: >>>
qubesd treats a qube's name as write-once, so a rename is a clone under the new
name, repointing of the qubes that use it, and removal of the original.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L1-STATE
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_create
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_volume_clone_to
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_remove

[PRODUCT_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L2P-LIFECYCLE-030
TITLE: Qube removal
STATEMENT: >>>
The management tool shall remove a qube together with its storage volumes.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Ansible, Salt, QubesTools, Terraform
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L1-STATE
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_remove

[PRODUCT_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L2P-LIFECYCLE-040
TITLE: Qube start
STATEMENT: >>>
